## Design
- Spec: design/yawaragi/README.md — read it before any UI work. Check its Changelog for what changed since last time.
- The .dc.html files are visual references, not code to copy. To view them: `npx serve design/yawaragi`, then open Yawaragi Mobile.dc.html.
- Items under "Open decisions" are not ours to settle — leave a TODO and a placeholder.
- If the build and the spec disagree, ask; don't silently pick one.
